                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">12</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">LEVEL B - Build the twisting mass  |  B02 (Intermediate method)  |  EDUCATIONAL PROTOTYPE - not in the game repo.  Units: feet.
GUIDANCE: PROMPTED.  Each stage shows only its title and Goal - no Idea / Watch for / Wire-check hints. You've seen most of these nodes in B01 and Level A: recall them.
New in B02: lists. Range makes one value per floor, so every node after it works on all floors at once.
Red B02_Q## = question node.  Green _Correct = locked copy.  Blue _Choices = 12 locked wrong choices.
Questions: B02_Q01 Range (new)   B02_Q02 Multiplication (recall B01)   B02_Q03 Addition (new)   B02_Q04 Polygon (recall Level A)   B02_Q05 Rotate (recall B01)   B02_Q06 Loft (recall B01)   B02_Q07 Cap Holes (recall B01)   B02_Q08 Area (recall B01)</item>
                  </items>
